%% title: How the school website goes live
%% desc: The Admin picks a web address, a design and colours, and can add a logo. The website stays private until the Admin presses Publish and turn on. After that anyone can read it without logging in. The Admin can turn it off and on again.
flowchart LR
  S["Admin sets up<br/>address · design · logo"]:::admin --> B["Admin presses<br/>Publish and turn on"]:::admin
  B --> W["Website is on<br/>anyone can read it"]
  W --> O["Admin can turn it off<br/>and on again"]:::admin
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
